<title>JAPAN: Japan, US to hold follow-up talks on insurance pact.</title>
<headline>Japan, US to hold follow-up talks on insurance pact.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan and the United States will hold talks on June 11 to check recent developments following their insurance agreement last December, the Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Japan had agreed to give foreign firms access to its so-called &quot;primary&quot; sector, which includes life, property and casualty insurance, by 1998.</p>
</text>
